## Umbraco runtime state
# The database, logs and caches are per-machine. The demo is reproducible from empty:
# unattended install brings up the site, Clean supplies the content and media, and
# AutoLinkSchemaInstaller adds the keyword property to the document types.
**/umbraco/Data/
**/umbraco/Logs/
**/umbraco/mediacache/
**/umbraco/models/
**/umbraco/preview/
**/umbraco/TEMP/

## Media uploaded or installed at runtime
**/wwwroot/media/

